     ***************** CONVEXHULL 2D TEST ***********************
     * Geometry test file                                       *
     * testing of the 2d convex hull functionality of the       *
     * geometry lib                                             *
     ************************************************************

Input point
P0 (0, 0)
P1 (1, 0)
P2 (0, -1)
P3 (-1, 0)
P4 (2, 0)
P5 (0, -2)
P6 (-2, 0)
P7 (0, 2)

Hull point
P = -2,0,0

P = 0,2,0

P = 2,0,0

P = 0,-2,0


Point in hul
Point 0  (0,0) is in hull.
Point 1  (1,1) is in hull.
Point 2  (0,0) is in hull.
Point 3  (2,2) is not in hull.
Point 4  (-2,-2) is not in hull.


